# Absolute-URL host rules (pages.dev, www) used to live here but never
# actually redirected anything - Cloudflare Pages doesn't apply _redirects
# host-matching rules to its own project subdomains or to a project's
# attached custom domains. www -> apex is a Cloudflare zone-level Redirect
# Rule instead (dashboard, not in this repo). pages.dev -> apex is
# functions/_middleware.ts, since _redirects can't do it. Confirmed both
# lines here were silently inert (2026-08-15 investigation) before removing
# them - don't re-add without testing.

# @astrojs/sitemap generates sitemap-index.xml, not sitemap.xml. Rewrite
# (200, not a redirect) so the conventional URL still serves valid XML.
/sitemap.xml /sitemap-index.xml 200
